OL,3,AProtesters blame 'vulture funds' for
OL,4,ASpain's housing crisis
OL,5,
OL,6,FPierina Nicuray, a 21-year-old
OL,7,Funiversity graduate, has spent a week
OL,8,Fcamped out in Madrid's Puerta del Sol
OL,9,Fsquare.
OL,11,FLike many of the hundreds of others who
OL,12,Fhave pitched their tents here to
OL,13,Fprotest at Spain's housing crisis, she
OL,14,Fhas no doubts when it comes to
OL,15,Fdiagnosing the cause.
OL,17,F"It's the same problem as always," she
OL,18,Fsays. "A lack of homes."
OL,20,FShe adds: "Landlords are taking
OL,21,Fadvantage of the situation to raise
OL,22,Frentals, and then there's also Airbnb."
